  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "6cba4903-77c5-46fa-a7c0-b869310ee28c"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the closed ball {v : d(c, v) <= r} of radius r about c; today a scene token \
only"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"1ff3fabd-61d3-4832-93be-cd846850fa58"],

Cell["waits: InfraTube, the tube of radius s about a core", "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"0eb4102b-7021-46d4-a34b-b4a59029b950"],

Cell["\<\
waits: InfraCone, the cone of a given slope with apex at one end of an axis\
\>", "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"ca8da328-8633-47b4-936d-37e14bad947a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraAngle"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraAngle", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineGuideFunction",
  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "598133e8-0b8d-487a-a456-358d93ff51ff"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the angle at p between q1 and q2 in radians, Method \"Arclength\" or \
\"Alexandrov\", the comparison angle of the three distances; a method from \
the shortest paths waits"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"0f02718e-f62b-4c10-ac11-7ad8a8eed71f"],

Cell["\<\
waits: InfraCrossection, an invariant of four points, as the distance is of \
two points and the angle of three\
\>", "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"5e613177-efb7-44d5-a469-546f83d01d0b"]
}, Open  ]],

